.TH LUMOS\-MD 1 2026-11-16 "lumos\-md 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lumos\-md \- Markdown editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lumos\-md
.RI [ file " ...]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lumos\-md
edits Markdown files as source text, with syntax colours and format
commands. It follows CommonMark and GitHub Flavored Markdown. Every edit
is a text edit.
.PP
Each
.I file
given opens in its own tab, after the tabs of the last session. Without
one, the tabs of the last session open, or one empty document. If
lumos\-md is already running, the files open in its window, and this
start exits.
.PP
A few seconds after an edit, the unsaved text goes to a draft file.
After a crash, the next start offers to recover it.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print the options and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I \(ti/.config/lumos\-md/lumos\-md.ini
The settings. For debug lines in the log, add
.B debug=true
under
.B [log]
in this file.
.TP
.I \(ti/.local/state/lumos\-md/lumos\-md.log
The log, one line per event. At 1 MB it moves to
.IR lumos\-md.log.1 .
.TP
.I \(ti/.local/state/lumos\-md/open\-tabs
The open tabs, for the next start.
.TP
.I \(ti/.local/state/lumos\-md/drafts/
The drafts of unsaved text.
.TP
.I \(ti/.lumos\-md/
If
.I \(ti/.lumos\-md/lumos\-md.ini
exists, the settings, the log, the open tabs and the drafts are in this
directory instead.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Replaces
.I \(ti/.config
in the paths above.
.TP
.B XDG_STATE_HOME
Replaces
.I \(ti/.local/state
in the paths above.
.SH BUGS
https://github.com/confund0/lumos\-md/issues
